OL,3,GNEWSAFour men charged over Moygashel
OL,4,Abonfire hate display
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour men have been charged in
OL,7,Fconnection with a hate display placed
OL,8,Fon a bonfire in Moygashel in July.
OL,10,FThree of the men, aged 28, 38 and 58,
OL,11,Fhave been charged with displaying
OL,12,Fwritten material to stir up hatred or
OL,13,Farouse fear.
OL,15,FA 74-year-old man was also charged with
OL,16,Fintimidation.
OL,18,FAll four men are due to appear before
OL,19,FDungannon Magistrates' Court on
OL,20,FWednesday 16 September.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
